        "q": "What is the best paper period tracking chart?",
        "a": "Any chart that shows a row per day and columns for the data you want to capture works. Many users simply use a monthly calendar and mark cycle day 1 with a circle. More detailed templates are available as free printables and can be stored in a binder at home."
